This product is an independent, clean-room reimplementation of the ideas behind
Bart's PE Builder. It incorporates no code from that tool and bundles no
Microsoft or other third-party installation media; it operates only on a Windows
installation source the user supplies.

The compiled binaries statically link third-party Go modules. The full text of
every such module's license is reproduced in the THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES file that
ships alongside them.

